[C1] PASS after the residual R is removed in proportion to cell mass, the top-face transfer telescopes to zero: max |M_top| / max |M| over 50 columns = 1.0e-15
[C2] PASS dry gas and each species keep their column total: every face transfer is added to one cell and taken from the other: max |sum V dm| / sum V |dm| = 1.6e-16
[C3] PASS without a clamp each cell's total change is M_i - M_(i+1) = phi_i - R m_i / sum m: the clamp residual is round-off: clamp residual 2.1e-16; relative error of the face divergence 4.8e-16
[C4] PASS a face asking for more than the donor holds is clamped: the dry donor empties to round-off (no margin), the species keep their margin, the dry clamp mark is set and the clamp residual shows it: mark at the bottom 1; min dry -2.22e-16, min species 3.27e-15; clamp residual 0.8
[C5] PASS a species donor keeps 4096 ulp of its density: the margin is 1 - keep: double 9.09495e-13, float32 0.000488281
